msgstr ""
"I</var/spool/at/spool> Каталог для хранения выходных данных; права доступа к "
"каталогу 700, владелец root."

#. type: Plain text
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Specifies a limiting load factor, over which batch jobs should not be "
#| "run, instead of the compile-time choice of 0.8.  For an SMP system with "
